  "patternRefs": [
    "DPK-PAT-3136"
  ],
  "remediation": "Pin the declaration to an exact version or to the narrowest range the project tests, and update it deliberately. Specifically: fix a dependency of `type` `pom` without scope `import`.",
  "limitation": "It matches a dependency of `type` `pom` without scope `import` in the parsed pom.xml; it cannot tell whether the package is installed, whether any published version is affected by an advisory, or whether the dependency reaches production code."
}
